   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Ordering ideas",
   "texto": [
    "**Во-первых** (first) and **во-вторых** (second) order the arguments. **Кроме того** (plus) adds something else. **Поэтому** (therefore) indicates consequence.",
    "**Например** (for example) introduces an example and **факт** (a fact) serves as a test."
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Conclusion",
   "texto": [
    "**В результате** (as a result) shows the effect of something. **В итоге** (in the end) and **итак** (so in short) close the argument. **Таким образом** (thus) and **следовательно** (therefore) are more formal.",
    "**Вывод** (conclusion) is used at the end: **Мой вывод**: город лучше (my conclusion: the city is better)."
   ]
  },
